            </article>
            <article class="feature-card">
              <i class="bi bi-shield-check"></i>
              <h3>Workspace Clarity</h3>
              <p>Project and team state had to remain visible without clutter.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="feature-card">
              <i class="bi bi-shield-check"></i>
              <h3>Frequent Usage</h3>
              <p>The product would be used daily, so reliability and straightforward UX mattered.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="feature-card">
              <i class="bi bi-shield-check"></i>
              <h3>SaaS Readiness</h3>
              <p>Account and plan logic needed to fit the collaboration workflow cleanly.</p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section section-accent">
        <div class="container" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
