              <li>Built a clearer daily workflow tool for team execution.</li><li>Improved visibility into project status, ownership, and progress.</li><li>Prepared the product for SaaS delivery and subscription-based growth.</li><li>Added a solid collaboration and productivity case study to the portfolio.</li>
